    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakyabazinga bano: Amurafeli ow'e Shinari, Arioki ow'Ellasari, Kedorilaomeri ow'Elamu, ni Tidali ow'e Goiimu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baatanula olutalo ku bakyabazinga abandi bano: Bera ow'e Sodoma, Birisha ow'e Gomorra, Shinabi ow'e Adama, Shemeberi ow'e Zeboiimu, ni kyabazinga ow'e Bela ekyo nga ni Zoari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakyabazinga bano abataanu abasembyeyo, baayimba ghalala amagye gaibwe mu Kiiko eky'e Siddimu eyo nga n'Enhandha Eyomuunhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedorilaomeri yali abafugiire emyaka ikumi n'ebiri, aye mu mwaka ogweikumi n'esatu baamudheemera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ogweikumi n'ena Kedorilaomeri ni bakyabazinga abaali ku luuyi lwe, baidha n'amagye gaibwe baaghangulira Abarefa mu Ashiterothi Karanaimu, n'Abazuzi mu Hamu, n'Ababemi mu Shave Kiriathaimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'Abahori mu kiketezo kyaibwe Seiri eky'ensozi baababingirira okubatuusa mu Eluparani ku mbali kw'eirungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho baakyuka bairayo, baatuuka Enimishipate, ekyo nga ni Kadeshi, baaghangula ensi yoonayoona ey'Abamaleki, era n'ey'Abamori abaabanga mu Hazazoni Tamari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakyabazinga bano: ow'e Sodoma, n'ow'e Gomorra, n'ow'e Adama, n'ow'e Zeboiimu, era n'ow'e Bela ekyo nga ni Zoari, baaja n'amagye gaibwe okulwana olutalo mu Kiiko eky'e Siddimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalwanisa Kedorilaomeri kyabazinga ow'Elamu, ni Tidali kyabazinga ow'e Goiimu, ni Amurafeli kyabazinga ow'e Shinari, era ni Arioki kyabazinga wa Ellasari batyo bakyabazinga abana baalwanisa abataanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu Kiiko eky'e Siddimu mwali mwidhwire ebiina by'eitosi. Kale kyabazinga ow'e Sodoma n'ow'e Gomorra bwe baalumuka olutalo, baagwa mu biina ebyo, aye bakyabazinga bale abandi abasatu baawona, baalumukira mu nsozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abazigu baibwe baanhaga ebintu byonabyona eby'omu Sodoma ni mu Gomorra, n'emere yaibwe yoonayoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era ni Loti omwana wa muganda wa Aburamu, eyali ng'aba mu Sodoma yeena baamutwala nga munhage, baatwala n'ebintu bye, olwamala beejiira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omuntu eyawonagho yaidha yaakobera byonabyona Aburamu, Omuheburayi eyali ng'aba kumpi n'emiti gya Mamure Omuamori. Mamure ono ni baganda be, Esikoli ni Aneri, baali ba mukago n'Aburamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburamu bweyawulira nga batwaire owoluganda lwe nga munhage, yaaja n'abasaadha be abalwani, abaazaalirwa mu ndhu ye, ebikumi bisatu na ikumi na munaana, baabingirira bakyabazinga bale abana okutuuka e Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaayawula amagye ge mu bikunsu, baalumba abazigu obwire era baabaghangula. Era baababingirira okubatuusa e Hoba, ekiri ku luuyi olw'omukono omugooda ng'olingiriire e buvandhuba, bw'oba ng'oli e Damasiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale, yaiza ebintu byonabyona ebyali binhagiibwa. Era yaiza n'owoluganda lwe Loti, ghalala n'ebintu bye, era n'abakazi, n'abantu abandi abanhage.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburamu bweyaira ng'amaze okughangula Kedorilaomeri ni bakyabazinga be yali yeeyimbye nabo, kyabazinga wa Sodoma yaaja mu Kiiko eky'e Shave era ekyetebwa Ekiiko ekya Kyabazinga okumweisuusaayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.7.1+HEB.7.2+HEB.7.3+HEB.7.4+HEB.7.5+HEB.7.6+HEB.7.7+HEB.7.8+HEB.7.9+HEB.7.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 7:1-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era ni Melekizedeki, eyali kyabazinga ow'e Salemu era kabona wa Katonda Ali Ghaigulu Yeene, yaaleetera Aburamu eby'okulya n'omwenge ogw'emizabbibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamusabira enkabi ati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga ow'e Sodoma yaakoba Aburamu ati: “Abantu bampe, aye ebintu obitwale.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Aburamu yairamu kyabazinga oyo ati: “Ndayira mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda, oyo Katonda Ali Ghaigulu Yeene, eyakola eigulu n'ensi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nti tija kusigaza kawuuzi, oba akakosi ak'engaito, oba waire ekintu kyonakyona ekikyo olwo olobe kukoba oti, ‘Ninze eyakombaghaza Aburamu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tija kutwala kintu naire, okutoolaku ebyo abaisuka bange bye baaliire, era n'omugabo ogw'abasaadha abaaja ninze. Aye leka bakagwa bange, Aneri, ni Eshikoli, era ni Mamure, batwale omugabo gwaibwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
